@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

state Order {
  [*] --> StartOrder
}

state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state OutOfService
state RemovedFromService <<end>>

Order --> Arrival : [Delivery]
Arrival --> Preparation : [Arrived]

Preparation --> Operations : [Assigned to Ops]
Preparation --> Maintenance : [Requires Maint]

Operations --> Maintenance : [No More Flights or Requires Maint]

Maintenance --> Preparation : [Serviced and Ready]

Operations --> OutOfService : [Taken out of Service]

OutOfService --> RemovedFromService : [Permanently Withdrawn]

@enduml
